  <block type="procedures_defnoreturn" id="run1" deletable="false" x="20" y="20">
    <field name="NAME">runOpMode</field>
    <comment pinned="false" h="160" w="560">Autonoom ImuHiveAuto (BIOBUZZ, rood, start A6). 1) Rijdt rechtuit met IMU-koers (P-correctie op yaw). 2) Draait met de IMU naar de HIVE. 3) Bepaalt met de AprilTag-cluster RED AUDIENCE (tags 34-37, de rode omhoog-CELL) de robotpositie en rijdt naar de schietplek: 1,20 m recht voor de rode omhoog-CELL. 4) Schiet de 4 meegenomen POLLEN. 5) Rijdt met de camera (gele kleur-blobs) naar de gele POLLEN en zuigt ze op (max 4). 6) Rijdt naar de overkant (na de TIP is RED SCORING de omhoog-CELL), bepaalt opnieuw de positie met de AprilTags en schiet weer. 7) Herhaalt verzamelen + schieten (camera zoekt gele POLLEN, odometrie + AprilTags voor de positie, tag-hoogte kiest de omhoog-CELL) tot er geen gele bal meer is of de tijd op is. Portret-camera, 17,5 graden omhoog: ftcPose.x = omhoog, ftcPose.y = langs de lens, ftcPose.z = links.</comment>
    <statement name="STACK">
      <block type="comment" id="b481">
        <field name="COMMENT">Autonoom (rood, start A6): rij met IMU-koers, draai met de IMU naar de HIVE, zet de robot met de AprilTags op de schietplek en schiet.</field>
        <next>
          <block type="variables_set" id="b483">
            <field name="VAR" id="v_TICKS_PER_METER">TICKS_PER_METER</field>
            <value name="VALUE">
              <block type="math_number" id="b482">
                <field name="NUM">2200</field>
              </block>
            </value>
            <next>
              <block type="variables_set" id="b485">
                <field name="VAR" id="v_HIVE_HEADING">HIVE_HEADING</field>
                <value name="VALUE">
                  <block type="math_number" id="b484">
                    <field name="NUM">0</field>
                  </block>
                </value>
                <next>
                  <block type="variables_set" id="b487">
                    <field name="VAR" id="v_CAMERA_PITCH_DEG">CAMERA_PITCH_DEG</field>
                    <value name="VALUE">
                      <block type="math_number" id="b486">
                        <field name="NUM">17.5</field>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                    <next>
                      <block type="variables_set" id="b489">
                        <field name="VAR" id="v_CAMERA_FORWARD_M">CAMERA_FORWARD_M</field>
                        <value name="VALUE">
                          <block type="math_number" id="b488">
                            <field name="NUM">0.24</field>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                        <next>
                          <block type="comment" id="b490">
                            <field name="COMMENT">Veldposities (m): RED AUDIENCE-tags (cluster-midden = opening van de rode omhoog-CELL) en het richtpunt.</field>
                            <next>
                              <block type="variables_set" id="b492">
                                <field name="VAR" id="v_TAG_X">TAG_X</field>
                                <value name="VALUE">
                                  <block type="math_number" id="b491">
                                    <field name="NUM">-0.324</field>
                                  </block>
                                </value>
                                <next>
                                  <block type="variables_set" id="b494">
                                    <field name="VAR" id="v_TAG_Y">TAG_Y</field>
                                    <value name="VALUE">
                                      <block type="math_number" id="b493">
                                        <field name="NUM">-0.416</field>
                                      </block>
                                    </value>
                                    <next>
                                      <block type="variables_set" id="b496">
                                        <field name="VAR" id="v_CELL_X">CELL_X</field>
                                        <value name="VALUE">
                                          <block type="math_number" id="b495">
                                            <field name="NUM">-0.324</field>
                                          </block>
                                        </value>
                                        <next>
                                          <block type="variables_set" id="b498">
                                            <field name="VAR" id="v_CELL_Y">CELL_Y</field>
                                            <value name="VALUE">
                                              <block type="math_number" id="b497">
                                                <field name="NUM">-0.416</field>
                                              </block>
                                            </value>
                                            <next>
                                              <block type="variables_set" id="b500">
                                                <field name="VAR" id="v_SHOOT_DISTANCE_M">SHOOT_DISTANCE_M</field>
                                                <value name="VALUE">
                                                  <block type="math_number" id="b499">
                                                    <field name="NUM">1.2</field>
                                                  </block>
                                                </value>
                                                <next>
                                                  <block type="dcMotor_setProperty_Direction" id="b501">
                                                    <field name="IDENTIFIER">leftDriveAsDcMotor</field>
                                                    <field name="PROP">Direction</field>
                                                    <data>{"IDENTIFIER":"leftDrive"}</data>
                                                    <value name="VALUE">
                                                      <shadow type="dcMotor_typedEnum_direction">
                                                        <field name="DIRECTION">REVERSE</field>
                                                      </shadow>
                                                    </value>
                                                    <next>
                                                      <block type="dcMotor_setProperty_Direction" id="b502">
                                                        <field name="IDENTIFIER">rightDriveAsDcMotor</field>
                                                        <field name="PROP">Direction</field>
                                                        <data>{"IDENTIFIER":"rightDrive"}</data>
                                                        <value name="VALUE">
                                                          <shadow type="dcMotor_typedEnum_direction">
                                                            <field name="DIRECTION">FORWARD</field>
                                                          </shadow>
                                                        </value>
                                                        <next>
                                                          <block type="imu_initialize" id="b507">
                                                            <field name="IDENTIFIER">imuAsIMU</field>
                                                            <value name="PARAMETERS">
                                                              <block type="imuParameters_create" id="b506">
                                                                <value name="IMU_ORIENTATION_ON_ROBOT">
                                                                  <block type="revHubOrientationOnRobot_create1" id="b505">
                                                                    <value name="LOGO_FACING_DIRECTION">
                                                                      <block type="revHubOrientationOnRobot_typedEnum_logoFacingDirection" id="b503">
                                                                        <field name="LOGO_FACING_DIRECTION">UP</field>
                                                                      </block>
                                                                    </value>
                                                                    <value name="USB_FACING_DIRECTION">
                                                                      <block type="revHubOrientationOnRobot_typedEnum_usbFacingDirection" id="b504">
                                                                        <field name="USB_FACING_DIRECTION">FORWARD</field>
                                                                      </block>
                                                                    </value>
                                                                  </block>
                                                                </value>
                                                              </block>
                                                            </value>
                                                            <next>
                                                              <block type="variables_set" id="b509">
                                                                <field name="VAR" id="v_myAprilTagProcessor">myAprilTagProcessor</field>
                                                                <value name="VALUE">
                                                                  <block type="aprilTagProcessor_easyCreateWithDefaults" id="b508"/>
                                                                </value>
                                                                <next>
                                                                  <block type="comment" id="y1">
                                                                    <field name="COMMENT">Kleur-blob-processor voor gele POLLEN (portretcamera: beeld-X = omhoog/verder weg, beeld-Y = horizontaal, Y &gt; midden = rechts).</field>
                                                                    <next>
                                                                      <block type="colorBlobLocatorProcessorBuilder_create_assign" id="y2">
                                                                        <field name="COLOR_BLOB_LOCATOR_PROCESSOR_BUILDER" id="v_myColorBlobLocatorProcessorBuilder" variabletype="ColorBlobLocatorProcessor.Builder">myColorBlobLocatorProcessorBuilder</field>
                                                                        <next>
                                                                          <block type="colorBlobLocatorProcessorBuilder_setTargetColorRange" id="y3">
                                                                            <field name="COLOR_BLOB_LOCATOR_PROCESSOR_BUILDER" id="v_myColorBlobLocatorProcessorBuilder" variabletype="ColorBlobLocatorProcessor.Builder">myColorBlobLocatorProcessorBuilder</field>
                                                                            <value name="COLOR_RANGE">
                                                                              <shadow type="colorRange_constant_ColorRange">
                                                                                <field name="CONSTANT">YELLOW</field>
                                                                              </shadow>
                                                                            </value>
                                                                            <next>
                                                                              <block type="variables_set" id="y5">
                                                                                <field name="VAR" id="v_myColorBlobLocatorProcessor">myColorBlobLocatorProcessor</field>
                                                                                <value name="VALUE">
                                                                                  <block type="colorBlobLocatorProcessorBuilder_build" id="y4">
                                                                                    <field name="COLOR_BLOB_LOCATOR_PROCESSOR_BUILDER" id="v_myColorBlobLocatorProcessorBuilder" variabletype="ColorBlobLocatorProcessor.Builder">myColorBlobLocatorProcessorBuilder</field>
                                                                                  </block>
                                                                                </value>
                                                                                <next>
                                                                                  <block type="visionPortalBuilder_create_assign" id="y6">
                                                                                    <field name="VISION_PORTAL_BUILDER" id="v_myVisionPortalBuilder" variabletype="VisionPortal.Builder">myVisionPortalBuilder</field>
                                                                                    <next>
                                                                                      <block type="visionPortalBuilder_setCamera" id="y7">
                                                                                        <field name="VISION_PORTAL_BUILDER" id="v_myVisionPortalBuilder" variabletype="VisionPortal.Builder">myVisionPortalBuilder</field>
                                                                                        <value name="CAMERA">
                                                                                          <shadow type="navigation_webcamName">
                                                                                            <field name="WEBCAM_NAME">Webcam 1</field>
                                                                                          </shadow>
                                                                                        </value>
                                                                                        <next>
                                                                                          <block type="visionPortalBuilder_addProcessor" id="y9">
                                                                                            <field name="VISION_PORTAL_BUILDER" id="v_myVisionPortalBuilder" variabletype="VisionPortal.Builder">myVisionPortalBuilder</field>
                                                                                            <value name="VISION_PROCESSOR">
                                                                                              <block type="variables_get" id="y8">
                                                                                                <field name="VAR" id="v_myAprilTagProcessor">myAprilTagProcessor</field>
                                                                                              </block>
                                                                                            </value>
                                                                                            <next>
                                                                                              <block type="visionPortalBuilder_addProcessor" id="y11">
                                                                                                <field name="VISION_PORTAL_BUILDER" id="v_myVisionPortalBuilder" variabletype="VisionPortal.Builder">myVisionPortalBuilder</field>
                                                                                                <value name="VISION_PROCESSOR">
                                                                                                  <block type="variables_get" id="y10">
                                                                                                    <field name="VAR" id="v_myColorBlobLocatorProcessor">myColorBlobLocatorProcessor</field>
                                                                                                  </block>
                                                                                                </value>
                                                                                                <next>
                                                                                                  <block type="variables_set" id="y13">
                                                                                                    <field name="VAR" id="v_myVisionPortal">myVisionPortal</field>
                                                                                                    <value name="VALUE">
                                                                                                      <block type="visionPortalBuilder_build" id="y12">
                                                                                                        <field name="VISION_PORTAL_BUILDER" id="v_myVisionPortalBuilder" variabletype="VisionPortal.Builder">myVisionPortalBuilder</field>
                                                                                                      </block>
                                                                                                    </value>
                                                                                                    <next>
                                                                                                      <block type="telemetry_addTextData_All" id="b516">
                                                                                                        <value name="KEY">
                                                                                                          <block type="text" id="b515">
                                                                                                            <field name="TEXT">Status</field>
                                                                                                          </block>
                                                                                                        </value>
                                                                                                        <value name="TEXT">
                                                                                                          <block type="text" id="b514">
                                                                                                            <field name="TEXT">Klaar. Druk op START.</field>
                                                                                                          </block>
                                                                                                        </value>
                                                                                                        <next>
                                                                                                          <block type="telemetry_update" id="b517">
                                                                                                            <next>
                                                                                                              <block type="linearOpMode_waitForStart" id="b518">
                                                                                                                <next>
                                                                                                                  <block type="imu_resetYaw" id="b519">
                                                                                                                    <field name="IDENTIFIER">imuAsIMU</field>
                                                                                                                    <next>
                                                                                                                      <block type="comment" id="b520">
                                                                                                                        <field name="COMMENT">1) IMU: los van de muur, rechtsaf langs de rode muur naar de hoogte van de omhoog-CELL.</field>
                                                                                                                        <next>
                                                                                                                          <block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b524">
                                                                                                                            <mutation name="driveStraight">
                                                                                                                              <arg name="meters"/>
                                                                                                                              <arg name="targetHeading"/>
                                                                                                                              <arg name="maxPower"/>
                                                                                                                            </mutation>
                                                                                                                            <value name="ARG0">
                                                                                                                              <block type="math_number" id="b521">
                                                                                                                                <field name="NUM">0.12</field>
                                                                                                                              </block>
                                                                                                                            </value>
                                                                                                                            <value name="ARG1">
                                                                                                                              <block type="math_number" id="b522">
                                                                                                                                <field name="NUM">0</field>
                                                                                                                              </block>
                                                                                                                            </value>
                                                                                                                            <value name="ARG2">
                                                                                                                              <block type="math_number" id="b523">
                                                                                                                                <field name="NUM">0.4</field>
                                                                                                                              </block>
                                                                                                                            </value>
                                                                                                                            <next>
                                                                                                                              <block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b526">
                                                                                                                                <mutation name="turnToHeading">
                                                                                                                                  <arg name="targetHeading"/>
                                                                                                                                </mutation>
                                                                                                                                <value name="ARG0">
                                                                                                                                  <block type="math_number" id="b525">
                                                                                                                                    <field name="NUM">-90</field>
                                                                                                                                  </block>
                                                                                                                                </value>
                                                                                                                                <next>
                                                                                                                                  <block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b530">
                                                                                                                                    <mutation name="driveStraight">
                                                                                                                                      <arg name="meters"/>
                                                                                                                                      <arg name="targetHeading"/>
                                                                                                                                      <arg name="maxPower"/>
                                                                                                                                    </mutation>
                                                                                                                                    <value name="ARG0">
                                                                                                                                      <block type="math_number" id="b527">
                                                                                                                                        <field name="NUM">1.6</field>
                                                                                                                                      </block>
                                                                                                                                    </value>
                                                                                                                                    <value name="ARG1">
                                                                                                                                      <block type="math_number" id="b528">
                                                                                                                                        <field name="NUM">-90</field>
                                                                                                                                      </block>
                                                                                                                                    </value>
                                                                                                                                    <value name="ARG2">
                                                                                                                                      <block type="math_number" id="b529">
                                                                                                                                        <field name="NUM">0.5</field>
                                                                                                                                      </block>
                                                                                                                                    </value>
                                                                                                                                    <next>
                                                                                                                                      <block type="comment" id="b531">
                                                                                                                                        <field name="COMMENT">2) IMU: draai naar de HIVE.  3) AprilTag: naar de schietplek.</field>
                                                                                                                                        <next>
                                                                                                                                          <block type="variables_set" id="y188">
                                                                                                                                            <field name="VAR" id="v_CLUSTER_NAME">CLUSTER_NAME</field>
                                                                                                                                            <value name="VALUE">
                                                                                                                                              <block type="text" id="y187">
                                                                                                                                                <field name="TEXT">RED AUDIENCE</field>
                                                                                                                                              </block>
                                                                                                                                            </value>
                                                                                                                                            <next>
                                                                                                                                              <block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b532">
                                                                                                                                                <mutation name="goToShootingSpot"/>
                                                                                                                                                <next>
                                                                                                                                                  <block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b533">
                                                                                                                                                    <mutation name="readHeading"/>
                                                                                                                                                    <next>
                                                                                                                                                      <block type="variables_set" id="b537">
                                                                                                                                                        <field name="VAR" id="v_skew">skew</field>
                                                                                                                                                        <value name="VALUE">
                                                                                                                                                          <block type="math_arithmetic" id="b536">
                                                                                                                                                            <field name="OP">MINUS</field>
                                                                                                                                                            <value name="A">
                                                                                                                                                              <block type="variables_get" id="b534">
                                                                                                                                                                <field name="VAR" id="v_heading">heading</field>
                                                                                                                                                              </block>
                                                                                                                                                            </value>
                                                                                                                                                            <value name="B">
                                                                                                                                                              <block type="variables_get" id="b535">
                                                                                                                                                                <field name="VAR" id="v_HIVE_HEADING">HIVE_HEADING</field>
                                                                                                                                                              </block>
                                                                                                                                                            </value>
                                                                                                                                                          </block>
                                                                                                                                                        </value>
                                                                                                                                                        <next>
                                                                                                                                                          <block type="comment" id="b538">
                                                                                                                                                            <field name="COMMENT">4) Schieten.</field>
                                                                                                                                                            <next>
                                                                                                                                                              <block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b539">
                                                                                                                                                                <mutation name="shootAll"/>
                                                                                                                                                                <next>
                                                                                                                                                                  <block type="comment" id="y139">
                                                                                                                                                                    <field name="COMMENT">5) Rij naar de gele POLLEN en zuig ze op (max 4, G407: de intake stopt zelf bij 4).</field>
                                                                                                                                                                    <next>
                                                                                                                                                                      <block type="variables_set" id="y141">
                                                                                                                                                                        <field name="VAR" id="v_collectHeading">collectHeading</field>
                                                                                                                                                                        <value name="VALUE">
                                                                                                                                                                          <block type="math_number" id="y140">
                                                                                                                                                                            <field name="NUM">-90</field>
                                                                                                                                                                          </block>
                                                                                                                                                                        </value>
                                                                                                                                                                        <next>
                                                                                                                                                                          <block type="variables_set" id="y143">
                                                                                                                                                                            <field name="VAR" id="v_COLLECT_MAX_M">COLLECT_MAX_M</field>
                                                                                                                                                                            <value name="VALUE">
                                                                                                                                                                              <block type="math_number" id="y142">
                                                                                                                                                                                <field name="NUM">0.9</field>
                                                                                                                                                                              </block>
                                                                                                                                                                            </value>
                                                                                                                                                                            <next>
                                                                                                                                                                              <block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="y145">
                                                                                                                                                                                <mutation name="turnToHeading">
                                                                                                                                                                                  <arg name="targetHeading"/>
                                                                                                                                                                                </mutation>
                                                                                                                                                                                <value name="ARG0">
                                                                                                                                                                                  <block type="variables_get" id="y144">
                                                                                                                                                                                    <field name="VAR" id="v_collectHeading">collectHeading</field>
                                                                                                                                                                                  </block>
                                                                                                                                                                                </value>
                                                                                                                                                                                <next>
                                                                                                                                                                                  <block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="y146">
                                                                                                                                                                                    <mutation name="collectYellow"/>
                                                                                                                                                                                    <next>
                                                                                                                                                                                      <block type="comment" id="y147">
                                                                                                                                                                                        <field name="COMMENT">6) De rode HIVE is gekanteld: nu is de RED SCORING-CELL (tags 30-33) de omhoog-CELL. Die staat aan de overkant (+Y). Rij er met de IMU heen.</field>
                                                                                                                                                                                        <next>
                                                                                                                                                                                          <block type="telemetry_addTextData_All" id="y150">
                                                                                                                                                                                            <value name="KEY">
                                                                                                                                                                                              <block type="text" id="y149">
                                                                                                                                                                                                <field name="TEXT">Fase</field>
                                                                                                                                                                                              </block>
                                                                                                                                                                                            </value>
                                                                                                                                                                                            <value name="TEXT">
                                                                                                                                                                                              <block type="text" id="y148">
                                                                                                                                                                                                <field name="TEXT">Naar de overkant</field>
